              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 12:11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele nywebo amucenjele, nkaambo bayoomwaaba kumbeta, akumuuma muzikombelo, alimwi muyooima kubusyu bwabeendelezi abami nkaambo kandime, kuti mukabe bakamboni bangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 16:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele kuleelede kuti anzina Makani Mabotu akakambaukwe kumasi oonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bantu nibayoomutola kuyoomwaaba, mutayoolitibauki kuti ino tukaambe buti, pele makani ngumuyoopegwa kuciindi eco nciconya mukaambe ngao, nkaambo endinywe mwaamba pe, ngu-Muuya Uusalala nguuamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 7:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela muntu uyooaba mwanaakwabo kukufwa, alakwe wisi uyooaba mwana, alimwi bana bayoobukila bazyali babo, bakabajazye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.15.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh 15:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyoosulwa kubantu boonse nkaambo kazina lyangu, pele walo oyo uuyookakatila mane do kumamanino nguuyoofutulwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
