        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ayo ayooba mazuba aamapenzi. Kuzwa kumalengelo Leza naakaanza nyika mane sunu ayo mapenzi aali boobo taakwe naakabwenwe, alimwi taakwe naati kabonwe limbi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova naatakafwiinsya mazuba ayo, nikwatazooba muntu naba umwi wali kunoozoofutulwa, pele nkaambo kabasale mbaakasala ncaayoofwiinsigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kuciindi eco kufumbwa muntu nayoomwaambila kuti, Amubone, nguuno Kristo, nikuba kuti, Nguulya, mutakazumini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
